From 0d23740023c8602a4daca474374f94e5014243df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Cheng <chengyuejia@foxmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 02:11:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kv-cache): support int4 and fp4_e2m1 KV cache dtype
 extensions
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add new KV cache quantization dtype support for int4 and fp4_e2m1,
complementing the existing nvfp4 path. These are runtime quantization
modes for the KV cache only — they do not affect model weights.

- Extend CacheDType with int4, fp4_e2m1, int8, kivi_int4
- Add int4 and fp4_e2m1 to STR_DTYPE_TO_TORCH_DTYPE mapping
- Extend is_quantized_kv_cache() to detect the new dtypes
- Add KVQuantMode.INT4 (=6) and KVQuantMode.FP4_E2M1 (=7)
- Add get_kv_quant_mode() mappings for int4 and fp4_e2m1
- Add int4_kv_cache_full_dim() and fp4_e2m1_kv_cache_full_dim() helpers

Test commands run:
  .venv/bin/python3 -m pytest tests/test_kv_cache_dtype_ext.py -v --noconftest
  .venv/bin/python3 -m pytest tests/test_kv_cache_dtype_ext_standalone.py -v --noconftest
All 82 tests passed.

